Notes on the behavior:
- **Title matching:** a substring check on the lowercased title, so "Likely" or "Somewhat" also match because they contain "like" or "what".
- **Word splitting:** content is split on whitespace, and punctuation characters are removed from each token. So `"see?"` becomes `"see"`, and `"don't"` becomes `"dont"`.
